# Bounded World 1 route diagnostic. Fresh save; map transfer is a fixture.
# Diagnostic completion/direction flags only; not proof of actual exit events.
# Clean-session input route shared by reference and native hosts.
# No imported savestates. Fixture writes are explicit; waits count guest frames.
wait 600
dump title
press start 2
wait 180
dump files
press start 2
wait 900
dump intro
press b 30
wait 180
press a 30
wait 180
poke 0109 00

# Practice map transfer: map 0, X=0x048, Y=0x198.
